# Frontend UI (backend SPA)

When editing files under **`frontend/`**, follow the UX/UI constitution and design-token package.

## Read first

- [docs/design/UX_UI_CONSTITUTION.md](../../docs/design/UX_UI_CONSTITUTION.md)
- [image-scoring-ui UX_UI_CONSTITUTION.md](https://github.com/synthet/image-scoring-ui/blob/main/docs/UX_UI_CONSTITUTION.md)
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/backend-frontend-ui/SKILL.md`

## Rules

- Use `@synthet/image-scoring-design` CSS variables or Tailwind `@theme` utilities — **no new hex literals**
- Reuse `frontend/src/components/ui/` and `PhaseStatusIcon` for new chrome
- After token package changes: `cd frontend && npm run design:sync && npm run design:check`
